    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100105/1021001050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001050070,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "……私のことはさっさと追い払うべきでした\r\n本当に見る目がない……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100105/1021001050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その……確かに俺は未熟だけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ごめんな、それには頷けない\r\n……円香を選んだのは間違いじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001050080,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "歯の浮くようなセリフ……！\r\nここは舞踏会ですか、王子様……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100105/1021001050080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "円香にはアイドルとしての才能がある\r\nこれからさらにもっと──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001050090,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "さらにもっと？　そこで知るのは？\r\n身の程って現実でしょ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100105/1021001050090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001050100,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "──……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100105/1021001050100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ああ、そうか……円香は……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001050110,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "アイドルなんか知りたくなかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100105/1021001050110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001050120,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "期待なんか背負いたくない\r\n必死になんか生きたくない",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102100105/1021001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1021001050130,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "自分のレベルなんか試されたくない\r\n何度も……何度も……",
